e straggler variant includes turnId null messages between turns and after the last turn.\\\"],\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"Required downstream edge-case substrate exists and is verified.\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"FC-0.6 injection facility\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Verifier confirmed post-commit-advance and compact-write injection points are reachable from tests, no-op when uninstalled, and propagate installed hook behavior.\\\"],\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"The named test seam substrate exists without production behavior when unused.\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"configured gates\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"pnpm run green-verify passed.\\\",\\\"pnpm run verify-all passed.\\\"],\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"Both story and epic gates recorded by the verifier are green.\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"approved deviations\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Impl-lead approved ViewProfileOverride[] widening and migration strftime seed timestamp in ruling-response 001.\\\"],\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"The only declared deviations have an explicit caller ruling and no open contract drift remains.\\\"}],\\\"callerInputHistory\\\":{\\\"reviewRequests\\\":[],\\\"rulings\\\":[{\\\"rulingRequestId\\\":\\\"00-foundation-story-run-001-ruling-spec-deviation\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"approve\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Both declared deviations approved by impl-lead. (1) ViewProfileOverride[] widening of SdkViewConfig.profiles is required to express FC-0.2's unknown-built-in-override-target violation and keeps complete ViewProfile assignable. (2) strftime seed timestamp in static migration SQL is a one-time seed; deterministic-clock requirements apply to production advance/reset writers (Stories 2/4), which use the injected clock. No behavior or contract drift.\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"impl-lead\\\"}]},\\\"runtimeIdentity\\\":{\\\"version\\\":\\\"0.4.0\\\",\\\"invocationSource\\\":\\\"unknown\\\",\\\"entryPath\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbui